## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Authorization memorials carry rich type-specific frontmatter:

- **`status`** — `active` / `suspended` / `rescinded`
- **`granted-on`** — ISO date the authorization was granted
- **`granted-by`** — who granted (typically the principal collaborator)
- **`motivation`** — one-paragraph why this authorization exists
- **`verbatim-directive`** — the principal's exact words granting it (epistemic anchor)
- **`authorized`** — what IS pre-authorized (concrete list)
- **`not-authorized`** — what is NOT pre-authorized (explicit carve-outs)
- **`filter`** — the quality gate that substitutes for per-instance approval
- **`risks`** — failure modes this authorization enables
- **`re-evaluation-triggers`** — conditions under which to re-review
- **`history`** — timeline of status changes
- **`applies-in-session-from`** — session boundary where this takes effect

